  "releaseNotes": "v0.6.0: Anthropic prompt caching across Claude system prompt / conversation prefix / tool manifests (lower input-token cost on long sessions). gpt-5+ recognised as reasoning-model family (max_completion_tokens, default temperature 1.0); o-series detection tightened. Gemini 2.x thoughtSignature round-trip via ToolCall.ProviderSignature (fixes \"Function call is missing a thought_signature\" on tool follow-ups). Claude Opus 4.7+ omits temperature (server now rejects it). Fix Gemini function_response wrapping for JSON-array tool returns. XML docs across internals; rebuild against AssistStudio.Core 0.18.0.",
